:: FirstFriend [childhood]
# A Special Bond

Over the past moon, you've been playing more and more with another child your age. <<if $language eq "proto-indo-european">><<if $character.gender eq "female">>Pria<<else>>Agnis<</if>><<elseif $language eq "proto-uralic">><<if $character.gender eq "female">>Aino<<else>>Sampo<</if>><<else>><<if $character.gender eq "female">>Nefert<<else>>Khenti<</if>><</if>> seems to seek you out specifically, and you enjoy each other's company.

Today, <<if $character.gender eq "female">>she<<else>>he<</if>> approaches with something hidden behind <<if $character.gender eq "female">>her<<else>>his<</if>> back.

"I found something special," your friend says with a grin. "Close your eyes and hold out your hands."

When you do, you feel something placed in your palms. Opening your eyes, you see a beautiful shell, unlike any you've seen before. It must have come from far away, perhaps traded from another tribe that lives near the great water.

"It's for you," your friend says. "Because you're my favorite person to play with."

This simple gift represents something important - your first real friendship, a bond that goes beyond just playing together. In a small tribe where cooperation is essential for survival, these relationships will be crucial throughout your life.

<<set $relationships.bestFriend += 10>>

<div class="relationship-change positive-change">
  Your relationship with your best friend has greatly improved!
</div>

<<link "Give a gift in return">>
  <<set $relationships.bestFriend += 5>>
  <<goto "ReturnGift">>
<</link>>

<<link "Suggest a special adventure together">>
  <<set $relationships.bestFriend += 3>>
  <<goto "FriendAdventure">>
<</link>>